# exercises constructs the corpus example does not: COMPD_CS, GEOCCS,
# LOCAL_CS, ESRI authority, the remaining axis directions, a free-text axis
# orientation, a short (3-value) TOWGS84, and omitted optional clauses.
GEOCCS1=GEOCCS("Test Geocentric", DATUM("Test Datum", SPHEROID("Test Spheroid", 6378137.0, 298.257223563), TOWGS84(0.0, 0.0, 0.0)), PRIMEM("Greenwich", 0.0), UNIT("metre", 1.0), AXIS("Geocentric X", GEOCENTRIC_X), AXIS("Geocentric Y", GEOCENTRIC_Y), AXIS("Geocentric Z", GEOCENTRIC_Z), AUTHORITY["ESRI","1000001"])
